msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
"तपाईँ Alt कुञ्जी समातेर र ट्याब वा Shift+Tab थिचेर वास्तविक डेस्कटपमा सञ्झ्यालहरू मार्फत\n"
"परिक्रमण गर्न सक्नुहुन्छ ।</p><br>\n"
"<center><img src=\"crystalsvg/48x48/apps/kcmkwm.png\"></center></p>\n"
"<p>धेरै जानकारीका लागि, <a\n"
"href=\"help:/khelpcenter/userguide/windows-how-to-work.html\"> केडीई\n"
"प्रयोगकर्ता गाइड हेर्नुहोस् ।</a>.</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:72
msgid ""
"<p>The KDE project was founded in October 1996 and had its first release,\n"
"1.0, on July 12, 1998.</p>\n"
"<p>You can <em>support the KDE project</em> with work (programming, "
"designing,\n"
"documenting, proof-reading, translating, etc.) and financial or\n"
"hardware donations. Please contact <a\n"
" href=\"mailto:kde-ev@kde.org\">kde-ev@kde.org</a>\n"
"if you are interested in donating, or <a\n"
"href=\"mailto:kde-quality@kde.org\">kde-quality@kde.org</a> if you would\n"
"like to contribute in other ways.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>केडीई परियोजना १९९६ अक्टोवरमा फेला परेको हो र १९९८, जुलाई १२ मा यसको \n"
"पहिलो प्रकाशन १.० भएको हो ।</p>\n"
"<p>तपाईँले <em> (प्रोग्रामिङ, डिजाइनिङ, मिसिलिकरण, शुद्धाशुद्धी जाँच, अनुवाद इत्यादि) र "
"वित्तिय वा हार्डवेयर अनुदान कार्यहरू मार्फत KDE परियोजना समर्थन\n"
"गर्न सक्नुहुन्छ ।\n"
"यदि तपाईँ अनुदानमा रूची राख्नुहुन्छ भने, कृपया <a\n"
" href=\"mailto:kde-ev@kde.org\">kde-ev@kde.org</a>\n"
"मा सम्पर्क गर्नुहोस्, वा यदि तपाईँ अन्य तरिकाबाट सहयोग गर्न चाहनुहुन्छ भने <a\n"
"href=\"mailto:kde-quality@kde.org\">kde-quality@kde.org</a> मा सम्पर्क गर्नुहोस् "
"।\n"
"</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:85
msgid ""
"<p>KDE provides some shortcuts to change the size of a window:</p>\n"
"<table><tr>\n"
"<th>To maximize a window...</th>\t<th>click the maximize button...</th>\n"
"</tr><tr>\n"
"<td>...full-screen,</td>\t\t<td>...with the left mouse button</td>\n"
"</tr><tr>\n"
"<td>...vertically only,</td>\t<td>...with the middle mouse button</td>\n"
"</tr><tr>\n"
"<td>...horizontally only,</td>\t<td>...with the right mouse button</td>\n"
"</tr></table>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>केडीई ले सञ्झ्यालको साइज परिवर्तन गर्न केही सर्टकटहरू उपलब्ध गर्दछ:</p>\n"
"<table><tr>\n"
"<th>सञ्झ्याल ठूलो पार्न...</th>\t<th>ठूलो पार्ने बटन क्लिक गर्नुहोस्...</th>\n"
"</tr><tr>\n"
"<td>...बायाँ माउस बटन सहितको,</td>\t\t<td>...पूरा पर्दा</td>\n"
"</tr><tr>\n"
"<td>...बीचको माउस बटन सहित,</td>\t<td>...ठाडो रूपमा मात्र</td>\n"
"</tr><tr>\n"
"<td>...दायाँ माउस बटन सहित,</td>\t<td>...तेर्सो रूपमा मात्र</td>\n"
"</tr></table>\n"

#: tips.cpp:99
msgid ""
"<p>You can stay up to date with new developments in KDE and releases\n"
"by regularly checking the web site <A\n"
" HREF=\"http://www.kde.org\">http://www.kde.org</A>.</p>\n"
"<BR>\n"
"<center><img src=\"oxygen/48x48/apps/konqueror.png\"></center></p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>तपाईँ वेब साइट जाँच गरेर केडीई मा नयाँ विकासहरू सँगसँगै अद्यावधिक हुन सक्नुहुन्छ \n"
"<A\n"
" HREF=\"http://www.kde.org\">http://www.kde.org</A>.</p>\n"
"<BR>\n"
"<center><img src=\"crystalsvg/48x48/apps/konqueror.png\"></center></p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:108
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "<p>\n"
#| "KDE is based on a well-designed C++ foundation. C++ is a programming\n"
#| "language well suited to desktop development. The KDE object model\n"
#| "extends the power of C++ even further. See\n"
#| " <a href=\"http://developer.kde.org/\">http://developer.kde.org/</a>\n"
#| "for details.</p><br>\n"
#| "<center><img src=\"oxygen/48x48/apps/konqueror.png\"></center>\n"
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"KDE is based on a well-designed C++ foundation. C++ is a programming\n"
"language well suited to desktop development. The KDE object model\n"
"extends the power of C++ even further. See\n"
" <a href=\"http://techbase.kde.org/\">http://techbase.kde.org/</a>\n"
"for details.</p><br>\n"
"<center><img src=\"oxygen/48x48/apps/konqueror.png\"></center>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
"केडीई राम्रोसँग डिजाइन गरिएको c++ संस्थामा आधारित छ । C++ डेस्कटप विकासमा सुहाउने "
"एउटा प्रगामिङ भाषा हो ।\n"
"केडीई वस्तु मोडेलले\n"
"अझ अगाडि C++ को शक्ति विस्तार गर्दछ । अझ धेरै जानकारीका लागि\n"
" <a href=\"http://developer.kde.org/\">http://developer.kde.org/</a>\n"
"हेर्नुहोस् ।</p><br>\n"
"<center><img src=\"crystalsvg/48x48/apps/konqueror.png\"></center>\n"

#: tips.cpp:119
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"You can use Konqueror to <strong>browse through tar archives</strong>,\n"
"even compressed ones. You can extract files simply by dragging them\n"
"to another place, e.g. another Konqueror window or the desktop.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
"एकपटक सङकुचन गरिएको भएता पनि टार सङ्ग्रह मार्फत <strong>ब्राउज गर्न</strong>,\n"
"तपाईँ कन्क्वेरर प्रयोग गर्न सक्नुहुन्छ । तपाईँले फाइलहरू सामन्य रूपमा तानेर, तिनीहरूलाई अर्को "
"ठाउँमा छोड्न सक्नुहुन्छ,\n"
"उदाहरणका लागि अर्को कन्क्वेरर सञ्झ्याल वा डेस्कटप ।</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:127
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "<P>\n"
#| "KDE's help system can display not only KDE's own HTML-based help, but\n"
#| "also info and man pages.</P>\n"
#| "<p>For more ways of getting help, see <a\n"
#| "href=\"help:/khelpcenter/userguide/getting-help.html\">the KDE User\n"
#| "Guide</a>.</p>\n"
#| "<br>\n"
#| "<center><img src=\"oxygen/48x48/apps/khelpcenter.png\"></center>\n"
msgid ""
"<P>\n"
"KDE's help system can display not only KDE's own HTML-based help, but\n"
"also info and man pages.</P>\n"
"<p>For more ways of getting help, see <a\n"
"href=\"help:/khelpcenter/userguide/getting-help.html\">the KDE User\n"
"Guide</a>.</p>\n"
"<br>\n"
"<center><img src=\"oxygen/48x48/actions/help-contents.png\"></center>\n"
msgstr ""
"<P>\n"
"केडीई को मद्दत प्रणालीले केडीई को आफ्नो HTML- आधारित मद्दत मात्र होइन, सूचना र मुख्य "
"पृष्ठहरू पनि\n"
"प्रदर्शन गर्न सक्छ ।</P>\n"
"<p>मद्दत प्राप्तको अरू धेरै तरिकाहरूका लागि, <a\n"
"href=\"help:/khelpcenter/userguide/getting-help.html\"> केडीई प्रयोगकर्ता\n"
"गाइड हेर्नुहोस् ।</a>.</p>\n"
"<br>\n"
"<center><img src=\"crystalsvg/48x48/apps/khelpcenter.png\"></center>\n"

#: tips.cpp:139
msgid ""
"<P>If a toolbar is not large enough to display all buttons on it, you can\n"
"click on the small arrow at the far right end of the toolbar to see\n"
"the remaining buttons.</P>\n"
msgstr ""
"<P>यदि यसमा सबै बटनहरू प्रदर्शन गर्न उपकरणपट्टी पर्याप्त मात्रामा ठूलो छैन भने, तपाईँले\n"
"बाँकी बटनहरू हेर्नका लागि उपकरणपट्टीको टाढा दायाँ अन्तिममा\n"
"सानो बाँणमा क्लिक गर्नुहोस् ।</P>\n"

#: tips.cpp:146
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "<p>\n"
#| "If you need to kill some time, KDE comes with an extensive collection\n"
#| "of games.</p><br>\n"
#| "<center>\n"
#| "<img src=\"crystalsvg/48x48/apps/package_games.png\">\n"
