"<p>\n"
"If you need to kill some time, KDE comes with an extensive collection\n"
"of games.</p><br>\n"
"<center>\n"
"<img src=\"oxygen/48x48/categories/applications-games.png\">\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
"यदि तपाईँ केही समय मार्न चाहनुहुन्छ भने, केडीई खेलहरुको एउटा\n"
"बाह्य सङ्कलनसँग आउँछ ।</p><br>\n"
"<center>\n"
"<img src=\"crystalsvg/48x48/apps/package_games.png\">\n"

#: tips.cpp:155
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "<p>\n"
#| "If you know its name, you can <strong>execute any program</strong> by "
#| "pressing\n"
#| "<strong>Alt+F2</strong>\n"
#| "and entering the program name in the command-line window provided.<p>\n"
#| "<br>\n"
#| "<center>\n"
#| "<img src=\"oxygen/48x48/apps/kmenu.png\">\n"
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"If you know its name, you can <strong>execute any program</strong> by "
"pressing\n"
"<strong>Alt+F2</strong>\n"
"and entering the program name in the command-line window provided.<p>\n"
"<br>\n"
"<center>\n"
"<img src=\"oxygen/48x48/apps/kde.png\">\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
"यदि तपाईँलाई यसको नाम थाहा छ भने, तपाईँले Alt+F2 थिचेर र उपलब्ध भएको आदेश रेखा "
"सञ्झ्यालमा कार्यक्रम नाम प्रविष्ट गरेर<strong>कुनै</strong>कार्यक्रम\n"
"<strong>कार्यान्वयन</strong>\n"
"गर्न सकनुहुन्छ<p>\n"
"<br>\n"
"<center>\n"
"<img src=\"crystalsvg/48x48/apps/kmenu.png\">\n"

#: tips.cpp:166
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "<p>\n"
#| "You can <strong>browse any URL</strong> by pressing\n"
#| "<strong>Alt+F2</strong> and entering the URL in the\n"
#| "command-line window provided.\n"
#| "</p><br>\n"
#| "<center>\n"
#| "<img src=\"oxygen/48x48/filesystems/network.png\">\n"
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"You can <strong>browse any URL</strong> by pressing\n"
"<strong>Alt+F2</strong> and entering the URL in the\n"
"command-line window provided.\n"
"</p><br>\n"
"<center>\n"
"<img src=\"oxygen/48x48/places/network-workgroup.png\">\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
"तपाईँले Alt+F2 थिचेर र उपलब्ध भएको आदेश-रेखा सञ्झ्यालमा यूआरएल प्रविष्ट गरेर <strong>कुनै</"
"strong> यूआरएल\n"
"<strong>ब्राउज</strong> गर्न सक्नुहुन्छ ।\n"
"\n"
"</p><br>\n"
"<center>\n"
"<img src=\"crystalsvg/48x48/filesystems/network.png\">\n"

#: tips.cpp:177
msgid ""
"<p>If you are using Konqueror and want to type another location into\n"
"the location field below the toolbar to get there, you can clear the\n"
"whole field very quickly with the black button with a white cross\n"
"to the left of the \"Location\" label and start typing.</p>\n"
"<p>You can also press Ctrl+L to clear the location field and place the\n"
"text cursor there.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>यदि तपाईँ कन्क्वेरर प्रयोग गर्दै हुनुहुन्छ र अर्को स्थानमा पुग्न उपकरणपट्टी मुनि स्थान "
"फाँटमा अर्को स्थान टाइप गर्न चाहनुहुन्छ भने,\n"
"तपाईँले चाडैनै कालो बटनको सहायताले \"स्थान\" लेबुल\n"
"र सुरु टाइपिङ्गको बायाँ पट्टी पूरै\n"
"फाँट हटाउन सक्नुहुन्छ ।</p>\n"
"<p>तपाईँले स्थान फाँट हटाउन Ctrl+L पनि थिच्न सक्नुहुन्छ र त्यहाँ पाठ\n"
" कर्सर राख्न सक्नुहुन्छ ।</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:187
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "<p>\n"
#| "If you cannot access the titlebar, you can still <strong>move a window</"
#| "strong>\n"
#| "on the screen by holding the Alt key, clicking anywhere into the window\n"
#| "and \"dragging\" it with the mouse.</p><br>\n"
#| "<p>Of course, you can change this behavior by using the Control Center.</"
#| "p>\n"
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"If you cannot access the titlebar, you can still <strong>move a window</"
"strong>\n"
"on the screen by holding the Alt key, clicking anywhere into the window\n"
"and \"dragging\" it with the mouse.</p><br>\n"
"<p>Of course, you can change this behavior in the System Settings.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
"यदि तपाईँले शीर्षकपट्टी पहुँच गर्न सक्नु भएन भने, तपाईँले अझै पनि सञ्झ्यालमा कुनै ठाउँ क्लिक "
"गरेर र यसलाई माउसले \"तानेर\" Alt कुञ्जी समातेर पर्दामा <strong>सञ्झ्याल सार्न </"
"strong>\n"
"सक्नुहुन्छ ।\n"
"</p><br>\n"
"<p>वास्तवमै, तपाईँले नियन्त्रण केन्द्र प्रयोग गरेर यो व्यवहार परिवर्तन गर्न सक्नुहुन्छ ।</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:196
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"You can <strong>resize a window</strong> on the screen by holding the Alt "
"key,\n"
"right-clicking anywhere into the window and moving the mouse.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
"तपाईँले माउसलाई सारेर र सञ्झ्यालको कुनै ठाउँ दायाँ-क्लिक गरेर, Alt कुञ्जी समाती "
"पर्दामा<strong>सञ्झ्याल रिसाइज </strong> गर्न सक्नुहुन्छ ।\n"
"</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:203
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"KDE's mail client (KMail) provides seamless <strong>PGP/GnuPG\n"
" integration</strong>\n"
"for encrypting and signing your email messages.</p>\n"
"<p>See <a href=\"help:/kmail/pgp.html\">the KMail Handbook</a> for\n"
"instructions on setting up encryption.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
"केडीई को मेल क्लाइन्ट (केडीई मेल) ले तपाईँको सन्देश गुप्तिकरण गर्न र साइनिङ गर्नका लागि "
"सीवनहीन <strong>PGP/GnuPG\n"
" इन्टिग्रेसन</strong>\n"
"उपलब्ध गर्दछ ।</p>\n"
"<p>गुप्तिकरण सेटिङ गर्न प्रशिक्षणका लागि<a href=\"help:/kmail/pgp.html\"> केडीई मेल "
"हातेपुस्तिका</a>\n"
"मा हेर्नुहोस् ।</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:213
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"You can find KDE developers all over the world, e.g., in Germany,\n"
"Sweden, France, Canada, USA, Australia, Namibia, Argentina, and even in\n"
"Norway!</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"To see where KDE developers can be found, take a look at <a href=\"http://"
"worldwide.kde.org\">worldwide.kde.org</a>.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
"तपाईँले केडीई विकासकर्ताहरूलाई संसारभर फेला पार्न सक्नुहुन्छ, उदाहरणका लागि, जर्मनी,\n"
"स्वीडेन, फ्रान्स, क्यानाडा, यू एस ए, अष्ट्रेलिया, नामीबिया, अरजेन्टिना, र नर्वेमा पनि!\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"केडीई विकासकर्ताहरू कहाँ फेला पर्छन् हेर्नका लागि, <a href=\"http://worldwide.kde.org"
"\">worldwide.kde.org मा हेर्नुहोस्</a>।\n"

#: tips.cpp:223
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"KDE's CD player, KsCD, accesses the Internet CD database freedb to provide "
"you\n"
"with title/track information.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>Full details of KsCD's functions are available in <a\n"
"href=\"help:/kscd\">the KsCD Handbook</a>.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
"केडीई को सीडी प्लेयर, KsCD, ले तपाईँलाई शीर्षक/ट्रयाक सूचना उपलब्ध गराउन इन्टरनेट सीडी "
"डाटाबेस \n"
"freedb पहुँच गर्दछ ।\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>KsCD's कार्यको पूरा विवरण <a\n"
"href=\"help:/kscd\"> KsCD हातेपुस्तिकामा उपलब्ध छ</a> ।</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:233
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "<p>\n"
#| "You can change the color of the window titlebars by clicking on the title "
#| "bar of the\n"
#| "example window in the <em>Appearance & Themes</em> module within the "
#| "Control Center.\n"
#| "</p>\n"
#| "<p>You can use the other aspects of the example graphic to further "
#| "customize the appearance of KDE on your computer.</p>\n"
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"You can change the color of the window titlebars by clicking on the title "
"bar of the\n"
"example window in the <em>Appearance</em> module within the System "
"Settings.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>You can use the other aspects of the example graphic to further customize "
"the appearance of KDE on your computer.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
"तपाईँको रङको शीर्षकपट्टीमा क्लिक गरेर सञ्झ्याल शीर्षकपट्टीहरूको रङ परिवर्तन गर्न सक्नुहुन्छ\n"
"उदाहरणका लागि नियन्त्रण केन्द्र भित्र <em>दृश्य र विषयवस्तु</em> मोड्युल ।\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>यसले अरू सबै रङहरूका लागि पनि काम गर्दछ ।</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:242
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "<p>\n"
#| "The difference between window manager styles and old-fashioned themes is\n"
#| "that the former even reflect window titlebar color settings from the\n"
#| "Control Center and might implement different features.</p>\n"
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"The difference between window manager styles and old-fashioned themes is\n"
"that the former even reflect window titlebar color settings from the\n"
"System Settings and might implement different features.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
"सञ्झ्याल प्रबन्धक शैलीहरू र पुरानो ढाँचाको विषयवस्तु त्यो हो जसले नियन्त्रण केन्द्रबाट\n"
" सञ्झ्याल शीर्षकपट्टी रङ सेटिङ प्रतिबिम्ब गर्दछ र कहिल्यै पनि भिन्न विशेषताहरू "
"कार्यान्वयन \n"
"गर्दैन ।</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:250
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "<p>If you want to know when <b>the next release</b> of KDE is planned,\n"
#| "look for the release schedule on <a\n"
#| " href=\"http://developer.kde.org/\">http://developer.kde.org</a>. If you "
#| "only\n"
#| "find old release schedules, there will probably be some weeks/months of\n"
#| "intensive development left before the next release.</p><br>\n"
#| "<center><img src=\"oxygen/48x48/apps/konqueror.png\"></center>\n"
msgid ""
"<p>If you want to know when <b>the next release</b> of KDE is planned,\n"
"look for the release schedule on <a\n"
" href=\"http://techbase.kde.org/\">http://techbase.kde.org</a>. If you only\n"
"find old release schedules, there will probably be some weeks/months of\n"
"intensive development left before the next release.</p><br>\n"
"<center><img src=\"oxygen/48x48/apps/konqueror.png\"></center>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>यदि तपाईँ केडीई को <b>पछिल्लो प्रकाशन</b> योजना जान्न चाहनुहुन्छ भने,\n"
"निस्काशन सूचीको <a\n"
" href=\"http://developer.kde.org/\">http://developer.kde.org</a> मा हेर्नुहोस् । "
"यदि तपाईँ केबल\n"
"पुरानो सूची फेला पार्नु भयो भने, त्यहाँ सम्भवत: अर्को निस्काशन हुनु अघि तीव्र विकासको केही "
"हप्ता/महिना\n"
"हुनुपर्छ ।</p><br>\n"
"<center><img src=\"crystalsvg/48x48/apps/konqueror.png\"></center>\n"

#: tips.cpp:260
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"Under the <em>\"B II\"</em> window decoration, the title bars\n"
"automatically move by themselves so they are always visible. You can\n"
"edit your title bar decoration by right clicking on your title bar and\n"
"selecting \"Configure Window Behavior...\".</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
"<em>\"B II\"</em> सञ्झ्याल सजावट अन्तर्गत, शीर्षकपट्टी स्वचालित रूपमा दृश्यात्मक हुनका "
"लागि आफै सर्छन् ।\n"
"तपाईँले\n"
"तपाईँको शीर्षकपट्टीमा दायाँ क्लिक गरेर र\n"
"\"सञ्झ्याल व्यवहार कन्फिगर...\" चयन गरेर शीर्षकपट्टी सजावट सम्पादन गर्न सक्नुहुन्छ ।</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:269
msgid ""
"<p>If you do not like the default completion mode (e.g. in Konqueror), you\n"
"can right-click on the edit-widget and choose a different mode, e.g.\n"
"automatic or manual completion. Manual completion works in a similar\n"
"way to\n"
"completion in a UNIX shell. Use Ctrl+E to invoke it.\n"
"</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>यदि तपाईँ पूर्वनिर्धारित समाप्ति मोड (जस्तै कन्क्वेररमा) मन पराउनु हुन्न भने, तपाईँ\n"
"सम्पादन विजार्डमा दायाँ क्लिक गर्न सक्नुहुन्छ र विभिन्न मोड जस्तै\n"
"स्वचालित वा म्यानुअल समाप्ति रोज्न सक्नुहुन्छ । म्यानुअल समाप्तिले युनिक्स शेल भित्र समाप्तिमा "
"एउटै तरीकाबाट\n"
"काम गर्दछ ।\n"
"यसलाई आह्वान गर्न Ctrl+E प्रयोग गर्नुहोस् ।\n"
"</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:279
msgid ""
"<p>If you want to contribute your own \"tip of the day\", please send it to\n"
"<a href=\"mailto:kde-doc-english@kde.org\">kde-doc-english@kde.org</a>, and "
"we will be happy to\n"
" include\n"
"it in the next release.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>यदि तपाईँको आफ्नै \"आजको टिप\"दिन चाहनुहुन्छ भने, कृपया यसलाई\n"
"<a href=\"mailto:kde-doc-english@kde.org\">kde-doc-english@kde.org</a>मा "
"पठाउनुहोस्, र यसलाई अर्को\n"
"प्रकाशनमा समावेश गर्दा\n"
"हामी खुशी हुनेछौं ।</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:287
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "<p>\n"
#| "If you drag a file from Konqueror or from the desktop to Konsole, you\n"
#| "will have the choice between pasting the URL or entering that folder.</"
#| "p>\n"
#| "<p>\n"
#| "Choose the one you want, so you do not have to write the entire path\n"
#| "in the terminal window.</p>\n"
#| "<p align=\"right\"><em>Contributed by Gerard Delafond</em></p>\n"
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"If you drag a file from Konqueror or from the desktop to Konsole, you\n"
"will have the choice between pasting the URL or entering that folder.</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"Choose the one you want, so you do not have to write the entire path\n"
"in the terminal window.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
"यदि तपाईँले कन्सोलमा कन्क्वेररबाट वा डेस्कटपबाट फाइल तान्नु भयो भने, तपाईँसँग\n"
"यूआरएल खेर फाल्ने वा त्यो फोल्डर प्रविष्ट गर्ने विकल्प हुनेछ ।</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"तपाईँले चाहेको एउटा रोज्नुहोस्, त्यसैले तपाईँले टर्मिनल सञ्झ्यालमा पूरा बाटो\n"
"लेख्नु हुदैन ।</p>\n"
"<p align=\"right\"><em>Gerard Delafond द्वारा सहयोग प्राप्त</em></p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:297
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"You can add your own \"Web Shortcuts\" to Konqueror by selecting\n"
"Settings->Configure Konqueror->Web Shortcuts. Click \"New...\" and\n"
"complete the fields.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>For further instructions, and details about the advanced features\n"
"available with Web Shortcuts, see <a\n"
"href=\"help:/konqueror/enhanced-browsing.html\">the Konqueror Handbook</a>.</"
"p>\n"
"<p align=\"right\"><em>Contributed by Michael Lachmann and Thomas Diehl</"
"em></p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
"तपाईँ सेटिङ->कन्फिगर कन्क्वेरर->वेब सर्टकट चयन गरेर कन्क्वेररमा आफ्नै  \"वेब सर्टकट\" थप्न "
"सक्नुहुन्छ ।\n"
"\"नयाँ...\" क्लिक गर्नुहोस् र\n"
"फाँटहरू पूरा गर्नुहोस् ।\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>वेब सर्टकटहरूसँगै उपलब्ध उन्नत विशेषताहरू बारे विवरणहरू, र अगाडि जानकारीका लागि,\n"
"<a\n"
"href=\"help:/konqueror/enhanced-browsing.html\"> कन्क्वेरर हातेपुस्तिका हेर्नुहोस्</a> "
"।</p>\n"
"<p align=\"right\"><em>Michael Lachmann र Thomas Diehl द्वारा सहयोग प्राप्त</"
"em></p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:310
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "<p>\n"
#| "Each UNIX user has a so-called Home folder in which his or her\n"
#| "files as well as user-dependent configuration files are saved. If you\n"
#| "work in a Konsole window, you can easily change to your home folder\n"
#| "by entering the <b>cd</b> command without any parameters.\n"
#| "</p>\n"
#| "<p align=\"right\"><em>Contributed by Carsten Niehaus</em></p>\n"
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"Each UNIX user has a so-called Home folder in which his or her\n"
"files as well as user-dependent configuration files are saved. If you\n"
"work in a Konsole window, you can easily change to your home folder\n"
"by entering the <b>cd</b> command without any parameters.\n"
"</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
"हरेक युनिक्स प्रयोगकर्तासँग तथा-कथित गृहफोल्डर हुन्छ जसमा उनीहरूको फाइल साथसाथै "
"प्रयोगकर्ता निर्भरता कनफिगरेसन फाइलहरू बचत हुन्छन् ।\n"
"यदि तपाईँले\n"
"कन्सोल सञ्झ्यालमा काम गर्नु भयो भने, तपाईँले कुनै परिमिति बिना नै <b>cd</b> आदेश प्रविष्ट "
"गरेर तपाईँको गृह फोल्डरमा सजिलै\n"
"परिवर्तन गर्न सक्नुहुन्छ ।\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p align=\"right\"><em>Carsten Niehaus द्वारा सहयोग प्राप्त</em></p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:320
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "<p>\n"
#| "You might wonder why there are very few (if any) files whose\n"
#| "names end in <code>.exe</code> or <code>.bat</code> on UNIX\n"
#| "systems. This is because filenames on UNIX do not need an\n"
#| "extension. Executable files in KDE are represented by the gear icon\n"
#| "in Konqueror. In the Konsole window, they are often colored red\n"
#| "(depending on your settings).\n"
#| "</p>\n"
#| "<p align=\"right\"><em>Contributed by Carsten Niehaus</em></p>\n"
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"You might wonder why there are very few (if any) files whose\n"
"names end in <code>.exe</code> or <code>.bat</code> on UNIX\n"
"systems. This is because filenames on UNIX do not need an\n"
"extension. Executable files in KDE are represented by the gear icon\n"
"in Konqueror. In the Konsole window, they are often colored red\n"
"(depending on your settings).\n"
"</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
"तपाईँले युनिक्स प्रणालीमा धेरै थोरै फाइल मात्र\n"
"<code>.exe</code> वा <code>.bat</code> मा अन्त भएको देखेर अचम्ममा पर्न सक्नुहुन्छ ।\n"
"यसको कारण चाँहि युनिक्समा फाइलनामको विस्तार आवश्यक पर्दैन ।\n"
"केडीई मा कार्यान्वयनयोग्य फाइलहरू कन्क्वेरर भित्र गियर प्रतिमाद्वारा प्रतिनिधित्व गरेका "
"हुन्छन् ।\n"
"कन्सोल सञ्झ्यालमा, तिनीहरू प्राय रातो रङमा हुन्छ\n"
"(तपाईँको सेटिङमा भर पर्दछ) ।\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p align=\"right\"><em>Carsten Niehaus</em> द्वारा सहयोग प्राप्त</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:332
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "<p>\n"
#| "If you want to make your desktop look more interesting, you can find\n"
#| "additional themes, widget styles, window decorations and more at <a href="
#| "\"http://kde-look.org/\">kde-look.org</a>.\n"
#| "</p>\n"
#| "<p align=\"right\"><em>Contributed by Carsten Niehaus</em></p>\n"
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"If you want to make your desktop look more interesting, you can find\n"
"additional themes, widget styles, window decorations and more at <a href="
"\"http://kde-look.org/\">kde-look.org</a>.\n"
"</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
"यदि तपाईँले आफ्नो डेस्कप धेरै रोचक देखाउन चाहनुहुन्छ भने, तपाईँले\n"
"विषयवस्तु, विजेट शैलीको सञ्झ्याल सजावट र अरू धेरै <a href=\"http://kde-look.org/"
"\">kde-look.org</a>मा फेला पार्नु सक्नुहुन्छ ।\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p align=\"right\"><em>Carsten Niehaus द्वारा सहयोग प्राप्त</em></p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:340
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "<p>\n"
#| "Did you know that you can use the middle mouse button to paste\n"
#| "text? Try selecting some text with the left mouse button and click\n"
#| "elsewhere with the middle mouse button. The selected text will be\n"
#| "pasted at the click position. This even works between different "
#| "programs.\n"
#| "</p>\n"
#| "<p align=\"right\"><em>Contributed by Carsten Niehaus</em></p>\n"
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"Did you know that you can use the middle mouse button to paste\n"
"text? Try selecting some text with the left mouse button and click\n"
"elsewhere with the middle mouse button. The selected text will be\n"
"pasted at the click position. This even works between different programs.\n"
"</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
"तपाईँलाई थाहा छ, तपाईँले पाठ टाँस्न बीचको माउस बटन प्रयोग गर्न सक्नुहुन्छ नी ?\n"
"बायाँ माउस बटनसँग केही पाठ चयन गरेर प्रयास गर्नुहोस् र\n"
"बीचको माउस बटनले कही पनि क्लिक गर्न सक्नुहुन्छ । चयन गरिएको पाठ क्लिक स्थानमा टाँसिने छ "
"।\n"
"यद्यपि यसले विभिन्न कार्यक्रमहरू बीच काम गर्दछ ।\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p align=\"right\"><em>Carsten Niehaus द्वारा सहयोग प्राप्त</em></p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:350
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"If you need to calculate a distance on the screen, the program\n"
"<em>kruler</em> can be of great help.</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"Furthermore, if you need to look closely at the ruler to count single\n"
"pixels, <em>kmag</em> may be very useful. (It is not part of the KDE base\n"
"installation but needs to be installed separately. It might already be\n"
"available on your distribution.) <em>kmag</em> works\n"
"just like <em>xmag</em>, with the difference that it magnifies on the fly.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p align=\"right\"><em>Contributed by Jesper Pedersen</em></p><br>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
"यदि तपाईँ पर्दामा दूरी गणना गर्न चाहनुहुन्छ भने, कार्यक्रम\n"
"<em>kruler</em> ठूलो मद्दत हुन सक्छ ।</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"अझ अगाडि, यदि तपाईँ नजिकबाट एकल पिक्सेल गणना गर्न रूलरमा हेर्न चाहनुहुन्छ भने,\n"
" <em>kmag</em> अति उययुक्त हुन सक्छ । (यो केडीई बेस स्थापनाको भाग होइन तर भिन्नै रूपमा "
"स्थापना हुन आवश्यक छ ।\n"
"यो तपाईँको\n"
"वितरणमा पहिल्यै उपलब्ध हुन सक्छ ।) <em>kmag</em> ले\n"
"<em>xmag</em>को जस्तो काम गर्दछ , फरक यति मात्र छ कि यो फ्लाईमा बढ्दछ ।\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p align=\"right\"><em>Jesper Pedersen द्वारा सहयोग प्राप्त</em></p><br>\n"

#: tips.cpp:365
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "<p>\n"
#| "You can associate sounds, pop up windows, and more with KDE events. This "
#| "can be configured\n"
#| "from the Control Center by selecting Sound &amp; Multimedia->System "
#| "Notifications.\n"
#| "</p>\n"
#| "<p align=\"right\"><em>Contributed by Jeff Tranter</em></p><br>\n"
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"You can associate sounds, pop up windows, and more with KDE events. This can "
"be configured\n"
"from the System Settings by selecting Notifications.\n"
"</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
"तपाईँ केडीई घटनाहरूसँग ध्वनिहरू, पपअप सञ्झ्यालहरू, र अरू धेरै मिलाउन सक्नुहुन्छ । यो नियन्त्रण "
"केन्द्रबाट\n"
"ध्वनि, मल्टिमेडिया->प्रणाली सूचनाहरू चयन गरेर कन्फिगर गर्न सक्नुहुन्छ ।\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p align=\"right\"><em>Jeff Tranter द्वारा सहयोग प्राप्त</em></p><br>\n"

#: tips.cpp:373
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "<p>\n"
#| "KDE's 'kioslaves' do not just work in Konqueror: you can use network\n"
#| "URLs in any KDE application. For example, you can enter a URL like\n"
#| "ftp://www.server.com/myfile in the Kate Open dialog, and Kate will\n"
#| "open the file and save changes back to the FTP server when you click\n"
#| "on 'Save.'\n"
#| "</p>\n"
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"KDE is a fully network transparent environment: you can use network\n"
"URLs in any KDE application. For example, you can enter a URL like\n"
"ftp://www.server.com/myfile in the KWrite Open dialog, and KWrite will\n"
"open the file and save changes back to the FTP server when you click\n"
"on 'Save.'\n"
"</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
"केडीई को 'kioslaves' कन्क्वेररमा मात्र काम गर्दैन: तपाईँ कुनै केडीई अनुप्रयोगमा\n"
"यूआरएल प्रयोग गर्न सक्नुहुन्छ । उदाहरणका लागि, तपाईँ RL  प्रविष्ट गर्न सक्नुहुन्छ जस्तै केट "
"खुल्ला संवादमा ftp://www.server.cm/myfile र जब तपाईँले 'बचत गर्नुहोस्' मा क्लिक "
"गर्नुहुन्छ केटले FTP सर्भरमा फाइल खोल्नेछ र पछाडि परिवर्तनहरू बचत गर्नेछ ।</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:384
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "<p>\n"
#| "You can use Konqueror to access your files on any server that you have\n"
#| "ssh access to. Just enter fish://<em>username</em>@<em>hostname</em> in\n"
#| "Konqueror's location bar.\n"
#| "</p>\n"
#| "<p>\n"
#| "In fact, all KDE applications support fish:// URLs - try entering one\n"
#| "in the Open dialog of Kate, for instance.\n"
#| "</p>\n"
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"You can use Konqueror to access your files on any server that you have\n"
"ssh access to. Just enter fish://<em>username</em>@<em>hostname</em> in\n"
"Konqueror's location bar.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"In fact, all KDE applications support fish:// URLs - try entering one\n"
"in the Open dialog of KWrite, for instance.\n"
"</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
"तपाईँ तपाईँको फाइलहरू पहुँच गर्न कुनै सर्भरमा कन्क्वेरर प्रयोग गर्न सक्नुहुन्छ जुन तपाईँ सँग ssh "
"पहुँच छ ।\n"
"कन्क्वेररको स्थानपट्टीमा fish://<em>प्रयोगकर्तानाम</em>@<em>होस्टनाम</em>\n"
"प्रविष्ट गर्नुहोस् ।\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"वास्तवमा, सबै केडीई अनुप्रयोगले fish:// URLs समर्थन गर्दछ - उदाहरणका लागि, केटको खुल्ला "
"संवादमा एउटा प्रविष्टि गरेर\n"
"प्रयास गर्नुहोस्\n"
"</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:397
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"KMail, the KDE email client, has built-in support for several popular\n"
"spam filtering apps. To set up automatic spam filtering in KMail,\n"
"configure your favorite spam filter as you like it, then go to\n"
"Tools->Anti-spam wizard in KMail.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"For more information, look at <a\n"
"href=\"help:/kmail/the-anti-spam-wizard.html\">the KMail Handbook\n"
"Anti-Spam Wizard chapter</a>.\n"
"</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
"केडीई मेल, केडीई इमेल क्लाइन्टले, विभिन्न प्रचलित स्प्याम फिल्टरिङ अनुप्रयोगहरूका लागि "
"समर्थन निर्माण गर्दछ ।\n"
"केडीई मेलमा स्वचालित स्प्याम फिल्टरिङ सेट गर्न,\n"
"तपाईँलाई मन परेको स्प्याम फिल्टर कन्फिगर गर्नुहोस्, त्यसपछि केडीई मेलमा\n"
"उपकरण->एन्टि-स्प्याम विजार्डमा जानुहोस् ।\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"अरू धेरै जानकारीका लागि, <a\n"
"href=\"help:/kmail/the-anti-spam-wizard.html\">केडीई मेल हातेपुस्तिका\n"
"एन्टि-स्प्याम विजार्ड अध्यायमा हेर्नुहोस् </a>।\n"
"</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:412
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"You can make a window go below other windows by middle-clicking on its "
"titlebar.\n"
"</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
"तपाईँ सञ्झ्यालको शीर्षकपट्टीमा बीचमा क्लिक गरेर तल जाने सञ्झ्याल बनाउन सक्नुहुन्छ ।\n"
"</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:419
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"KDE applications offer short \"What's This?\" help texts for many\n"
"features. Just click on the question mark on the window titlebar, and\n"
"then click on the item you need help on. (In some themes, the button\n"
"is a lowercase \"i\" instead of a question mark).\n"
"</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
"केडीई अनुप्रयोगहरूले धेरै विशेषताहरूका लागि छोटो \"यो के हो?\" मद्दत पाठहरू प्रस्ताव गर्दछ "
"।\n"
"मात्र सञ्झ्याल शीर्षकपट्टीमा प्रश्न चिन्हमा क्लिक गर्नुहोस्, र\n"
"त्यसपछि तपाईँले मद्दत गर्न चाहनु भएको वस्तुमा क्लिक गर्नुहोस् । (केही विषयवस्तुहरूमा, बटन "
"प्रश्न चिन्हको सट्टा\n"
"सानो अक्षर \"i\" हुन्छ) ।\n"
"</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:429
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "<p>\n"
#| "KDE supports several different window focus modes: take a look in the\n"
#| "Control Center, under Desktop->Window Behavior. For example, if you\n"
#| "use the mouse a lot, you might prefer the \"Focus follows mouse\" "
#| "setting.\n"
#| "</p>\n"
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"KDE supports several different window focus modes: take a look in the\n"
"System Settings under Window Behavior. For example, if you\n"
"use the mouse a lot, you might prefer the \"Focus follows mouse\" setting.\n"
"</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
"केडीई ले विभिन्न सञ्झ्याल फोकस मोडहरू समर्थन गर्दछ: डेस्कटप->सञ्झ्याल व्यवहार मुनि, "
"नियन्त्रण केन्द्रमा हेर्नुहोस् ।\n"
"उदाहरणका लागि, यदि तपाईँले\n"
"धेरै माउस प्रयोग गर्नु भयो भने, तपाईँले \"फोकसले माउसको अनुसरण गर्दछ\" सेटिङ छान्नुपर्दछ ।\n"
"</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:438
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"Konqueror can continuously scroll webpages up or down: just press\n"
"Shift+Up Arrow or Shift+Down Arrow. Press the key combination again to\n"
"increase the speed, or any other key to stop the scrolling.\n"
"</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
"कन्क्वेररले निरन्तर रूपमा वेबपृष्टहरू तल माथि स्क्रोल गर्न सक्छ: मात्र\n"
"Shift+Up Arrow वा Shift+Down Arrow थिच्नुहोस् । गति बढाउन फेरि कुञ्जी संयोजन "
"थिच्नुहोस्,\n"
"स्क्रोलिङ रोक्न अन्य कुनै कुञ्जी थिच्नुहोस् ।\n"
"</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:447
msgid ""
"<p>You can use Konqueror's help:/ kioslave to have quick and easy\n"
"access to an application's handbook by typing <b>help:/</b>, directly\n"
"followed by the application name, in the Location bar. So, for example\n"
"to view the handbook for kwrite simply type help:/kwrite.</p> \n"
msgstr ""
"<p>तपाईँले <b>help:/</b> टाइप गरेर एउटा अनुप्रयोगको हातेपुस्तिकामा छिटो र सजिलो पहुँच "
"गर्न कन्क्वेररको help:/ किओस्ल्याभ प्रयोग गर्न सक्नुहुन्छ\n"
", जुन स्थानपट्टीमा, अनुप्रयोग नामद्वारा प्रत्यक्ष रूपमा अनुशरण गरिएको छ ।\n"
"त्यसैले, उदाहरणको रूपमा,\n"
"साधारण केडीई राइटका लागि हातेपुस्तिका हेर्न help:/kwrite टाइप गर्नुहोस् ।</p> \n"

#: tips.cpp:455
msgid ""
"<p>Konqueror's Web Shortcuts feature lets you submit a query directly\n"
"to a search engine without having to visit the website\n"
"first. For example, entering <b>gg:konqueror</b> in the Location bar and\n"
"pressing Enter will search Google for items relating to Konqueror.</p>\n"
"<p>To see what further Web Shortcuts are available, and to make your\n"
"own, from Konqueror just select Settings->Configure Konqueror... which\n"
"will open the Settings dialog box, and then just click on the Web\n"
"Shortcuts icon.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>कन्क्वेररको वेब सर्टकट विशेषताले पहिले वेबसाइट भ्रमण नगरी इन्जिन खोजी गर्न प्रत्यक्ष "
"रूपमा क्वेरी पेश गर्न\n"
"तपाईँलाई अनुमति दिन्छ ।\n"
" उदाहरणका लागि, स्थानपट्टीमा <b>gg:कन्क्वेरर</b> प्रविष्ट गरेर र\n"
"इन्टर थिच्नाले कन्क्वेररमा सम्बन्धित वस्तुहरूका लागि गुगल खोजी गर्नेछ ।</p>\n"
"<p>कन्क्वेररबाट, अगाडि केडीई वेब सर्टकट उपलब्ध छ भन्ने हेर्न, र तपाईँको आफ्नो बनाउन,\n"
"मात्र सेटिङ->कन्फिगर कन्क्वेरर चयन गर्नुहोस्... जसले\n"
"सेटिङ संवाद बाकस खोल्नेछ, र त्यसपछि वेब सर्टकट प्रतिमामा क्लिक गर्नुहोस् ।\n"
"</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:467
msgid ""
"<p>KDE is always looking to improve its accessibility, and with the\n"
"launch of KTTS (KDE Text-to-Speech) you now have the power to convert\n"
"strings of text into audible speech. </p>\n"
"<p>KTTS is constantly improving, and currently provides support to\n"
"speak all or any portion of plain text files (as viewed in Kate), HTML\n"
"pages in Konqueror, text in the KDE clipboard, as well as speech of\n"
"KDE notifications (KNotify).</p>\n"
"<p>To start the KTTS system, you can either select KTTS in the KDE\n"
"menu, or hit Alt+F2 to run a command and then type <b>kttsmgr</b>. For\n"
"more information on KTTS, check the <a href=\"help:/kttsd\" title=\"KTTSD\n"
"Handbook\">KTTSD Handbook</a>.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>केडीई जहिले पनि यसको पहुँचता सुधार गर्न हेरिरहेको हुन्छ, र केडीई टीटीएस को सुरूआतबाट\n"
"(केडिई पाठ-बाट-वाक्यमा) तपाईँसँग अहिले पाठको स्ट्रिङहरू श्रव्यमूलक वाक्यमा रूपान्तर \n"
"गर्ने क्षमता हुन्छ ।</p>\n"
"<p>KTTS निरन्तर रूपमा सुधार भइरहेको छ, र खाली पाठ फाइलहरूको सबै वा कुनै भागमा बोल्न "
"समर्थन उपलब्ध गर्दछ\n"
"(केटमा हरेको जस्तै), कन्क्वेररमा\n"
"एच टी एम एल पृष्ठहरू, केडीई क्लिपबोर्डमा पाठ, त्यसैप्रकारले के डी सूचनाहरूको\n"
"वाक्य (KNotify) ।</p>\n"
"<p>KTTS प्रणाली सुरु गर्न, तपाईँ या त केडीई मेनुमा KTTS चयन गर्नुहोस्, वा\n"
"आदेश चलाउन Alt+F2 हान्नुहोस् र त्यसपछि <b>kttsmgr</b>टाइप गर्नुहोस् । केडीई टीटीएस\n"
"को बारे अझ धेरै जानकारीका लागि, <a href=\"help:/kttsd\" title=\"KTTSD\n"
"Handbook\">KTTSD हातेपुस्तिका जाँच्नुहोस्</a> ।</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:482
msgid ""
"<p>Though KDE is a very stable desktop environment, programs may\n"
"occasionally freeze or crash, particularly if you are running the\n"
"development version of a program, or a program made by a\n"
"third-party. In this case, you can forcibly kill the program if need\n"
"be.</p>\n"
"<p>Pressing <b>Ctrl+Alt+Esc</b> will bring up the skull-and-crossbones\n"
"cursor, and once you click on a window with it the program will be\n"
"automatically killed. Note, however, that this is an untidy way of\n"
"shutting down the program which may result in data being lost, and\n"
"some partner processes may still remain running. This should only be\n"
"used as a last resort.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>यद्यपि केडीइ धेरै स्थिर डेस्कटप परिवेश हो,\n"
"यदि तपाईँ निश्चित रूपमा कार्यक्रमको विकास संस्करण, वा तेस्रो पक्षले बनाएको कार्यक्रम,\n"
"चलाइरहनु भएको छ भने, कार्यक्रमहरू\n"
"समय समयमा रोकिन वा क्र्यास हुन सक्छ ।\n"
"यस्तो अवस्थामा, यदि आवश्यक परेमा तपाईँले बलपूर्वक कार्यक्रम नष्ट गर्न सक्नुहुन्छ ।\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p><b>Ctrl+Alt+Esc</b> थिच्नाले स्कुल-र-क्रसबोन ल्याउनेछ,\n"
"र एकपटक यो कार्यक्रमसँग सञ्झ्यालमा क्लिक गर्नाले स्वचालित रूपमा सिद्धिनेछ ।\n"
"याद गर्नुहोस्, जे भए पनि, यो कार्यक्रम बन्द गर्ने एउटा गलत तरीका हो\n"
"जसले नतिजाले डेटा हराउनेछ, र\n"
"केही पार्टनरहरूको प्रक्रियाहरू अझै चलिरहेको हुनेछ । यो नै अन्तिम उपाय\n"
"को रूपमा प्रयोग हुनेछ ।</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:497
msgid ""
"<p>KMail is KDE's email client, but did you know that you can\n"
"integrate it -- along with other programs -- to bring them all under\n"
"one roof? Kontact was made to be a Personal Information Management\n"
"suite, and it integrates all components under it seamlessly.</p>\n"
"<p>Other possible programs to integrate with Kontact include\n"
"KAddressBook (for handling Contacts), KNotes (for keeping notes),\n"
"KNode (to keep up-to-date with the latest news), and KOrganizer (for a\n"
"comprehensive calender).</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>केडीई मेल केडीई को इमेल क्लाइन्ट हो, तर तपाईँलाई थाहा छ तिनीहरूलाई एउटै छानामा "
"ल्याउन\n"
"--अन्य कार्यक्रमहरूसँग -- एकीकरण गर्न सक्नुहुन्छ ?\n"
"कोन्ट्याक्ट व्यक्तिगत सूचना व्यवस्थापन मिलेको हुनका लागि बनाइएको हो,\n"
"र यो यसको सिमलेस्ली अन्तर्गत सबै अवयवहरू एकीकरण गर्दछ ।</p>\n"
"<p> कोन्ट्याक सँग एकीकरण गर्न अन्य सम्भाव्य कार्यक्रमहरू केडीई ठेगानापुस्तिका (सम्पर्कहरू "
"ह्यान्ड्लिङ गर्न),\n"
"केनोटहरू (नोटहरू राख्न),\n"
"केडीई नोड (पछिल्लो खबरहरूसँग अद्यावधिक राख्न), र केडीई आयोजक (व्यापक क्यालेन्डरको लागि) "
"समावेश गर्दछ ।\n"
"</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:509
msgid ""
"<p>By pressing F4 in Konqueror you can open a terminal at your current\n"
"location.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>कनक्वेररमा F4 थिचेर तपाईँ हालको स्थानमा टर्मिनल खोल्न सक्नुहुन्छ ।\n"
"</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:515
msgid ""
"<p>Although KDE will automatically restore your KDE programs that were\n"
"left open after you logged out, you can specifically tell KDE to start\n"
"particular applications on start up; see the <a\n"
"href=\"help:/khelpcenter/faq/configure.html#id2574142\" title=\"Autostart\n"
"FAQ\">FAQ entry</a> for more information.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p> यद्यपि तपाईँले लगआउट गर्दा खुल्लै छोडेको तपाईँको केडीई कार्यक्रमहरू केडीई ले स्वचालित "
"रूपमा पूर्वावस्थामा ल्याउनेछ\n"
"तपाईँले केडीई लाई विशेष रूपमा निश्चित अनुप्रयोगहरू सुरुआतमा सुरु गर्नका लागि भन्न सक्नुहुन्छ;\n"
"अरू धेरै जानकारीका लागि <a\n"
"href=\"help:/khelpcenter/faq/configure.html#id2574142\" title=\"Autostart\n"
"FAQ\">FAQ प्रविष्टि</a> हेर्नुहोस् ।</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:524
msgid ""
"<p>You can integrate Kontact, KDE's Personal Information Management\n"
"suit, with Kopete, KDE's Instant Messenger client, so that you can\n"
"view contacts' online status, as well as respond to them easily from\n"
"KMail itself. For a step-by-step guide, check <a\n"
"href=\"help:/khelpcenter/userguide/integrated-messaging.html\"\n"
"title=\"Integrated Messaging\">the KDE User Guide</a>.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>तपाईँले कोपेटे, केडीई को आवश्यक सन्देश क्लाइन्टसँग, कोन्ट्याक्ट, केडीई को व्यक्तिगत सूचना "
"व्यवस्थापन सुइट एकीकरण गर्न सक्नुहुन्छ,\n"
"जसले गर्दा तपाईँ 'अनलाइन वस्तुस्थिति' सम्पर्कहरू र तिनीहरूलाई केडीई मेलबाट सजिलो "
"प्रतिक्रिया\n"
"दिन सक्नुहुन्छ ।\n"
"हेरक चरणमा मार्गदर्शकका लागि, <a\n"
"href=\"help:/khelpcenter/userguide/integrated-messaging.html\"\n"
"title=\"Integrated Messaging\">केडीई प्रयोगकर्ता मार्गदर्शक जाँच्नुहोस् </a> ।</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:534
msgid ""
"<p>By entering <b>kmail --composer</b> in Konsole you can\n"
"have KMail only open up the composer window, so that you do not have to\n"
"open the entire email client when you only want to send an email to\n"
"someone.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>कन्सोलमा <b>केडीई मेल --कम्पोजर</b> प्रविष्ट गरेर\n"
"तपाईँसँग कम्पोजर सञ्झ्याल खोल्न केडीई मेल मात्र हुनेछ, त्यसैले तपाईँले कसैलाई एउटा मात्र इमेल "
"पठाउँदा\n"
"पूरै इमेल क्लाइन्ट खोल्नु हुँदैन ।\n"
"</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:542
msgid ""
"<p>While tabbed browsing in Konqueror is very useful, you can take\n"
"this one step further if you choose to have a split view in order to\n"
"view two locations at the same time. To access this feature, in\n"
"Konqueror select Window->Split View, with either Top-Bottom or\n"
"Left/Right, depending upon your choice.</p>\n"
"<p>This setting will also only apply to a particular tab, rather than\n"
"all tabs you have, so you can choose to have the split view for only\n"
"some of the tabs where you might think it is useful.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>ट्याब गर्दा क्नक्वेररमा ब्राउजिङ अति उपयुक्त हुन्छ,\n"
"यदि तपाईँले एउटै समयमा दुई स्थानहरू हेर्न स्प्लिट दृश्य छान्नु पर्यो भने, तपाईँले यो एउटा चरण "
"अगाडि लानु सक्नुहुन्छ ।\n"
"यो विशेषता पहुँच गर्न, या त माथिल्लो बटन वा दायाँ/बायाँ छानेर, कन्क्वेररमा\n"
"सञ्झ्याल->विभाजित दृश्य चयन गर्नुहोस् ।\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>यो सेटिङ पनि तपाईँसँग भएको सबै ट्याबहरू भन्दा, निश्चित ट्याबमा मात्र लागू हुन्छ,\n"
"त्यसैले तपाईँले केही ट्याबहरूका लागि मात्र विभाजित दृश्य रोज्न सक्नुहुन्छ जहाँ तपाईँ यो उपयुक्त "
"ठान्नुहुन्छ ।\n"
"</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:554
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "<p>\n"
#| "You can let KDE turn the <b>NumLock</b> ON or OFF at startup.\n"
#| "</p>\n"
#| "<p>\n"
#| "Open the Control Center, select Peripherals->Keyboard and make your\n"
#| " choice.\n"
#| "</p>\n"
#| "<p>\n"
#| "<hr><br><br>\n"
#| "<i>This is the last tip in the tips database. Clicking \"Next\" will take "
#| "you back to\n"
#| " the first tip.</i>\n"
#| "</p>\n"
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"You can let KDE turn the <b>NumLock</b> ON or OFF at startup.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"Open the System Settings, select Keyboard &amp; Mouse and make your\n"
" choice.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"<hr><br><br>\n"
"<i>This is the last tip in the tips database. Clicking \"Next\" will take "
"you back to\n"
" the first tip.</i>\n"
"</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
"तपाईँ सुरुआतमा केडीई लाई <b>नम्स लक</b> बन्द गर्न वा खोल्न दिन सक्नुहुन्छ ।\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"नियन्त्रण केन्द्र खोल्नुहोस्, परिधीय->कुञ्जीपाट चयन गर्नुहोस् र तपाईँको \n"
"  छनोट बनाउनुहोस् ।\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"<hr><br><br>\n"
"<i>यो टिप डाटाबेसमा अन्तिम टिप हो । \"पछिल्लो\" मा क्लिक गरेर तपाईँलाई\n"
" पहिलो टिपमा पुर्याउँछ ।</i>\n"
"</p>\n"

#~ msgid ""
