#~ "<li>use Konsole tabs (Ctrl+Shift+n) if you need text output.\n"
#~ "</ul>\n"
#~ "<p>On the topic of konsole tabs, if you want to keep track of what\n"
#~ "task you are doing in each tab, you can rename the active tab\n"
#~ "by typing Ctrl+Alt+s. So now you can have a shell that you are logged\n"
#~ "in as root named \"root\".</p>\n"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "<p>\n"
#~ "केही व्यक्तिले धेरैजसो टर्मिनल सञ्झ्याल मात्र एउटा एकल आदेश <em>प्रविष्ट गर्न</em>\n"
#~ "खोल्दछ ।</p>\n"
#~ "<ul>\n"
#~ "<li>(Alt+F2 \"kword\") कार्यक्रम हटाउनका लागि <strong>Alt+F2</strong> प्रयोग "
#~ "गर्नुहोस् वा\n"
#~ "<li>यदि तपाईँ पाठ निर्गत चाहनुहुन्छ भने Konsole सत्र ( उपकरणपट्टीमा\"New\" ) "
#~ "प्रयोग गर्नुहोस् ।\n"
